@@ -0,0 +1,36 @@
+# POST /api/sheets/{sheetId}/people/{personId}/transfer-undo — a steward undoes the transfer that brought the person to
+# this sheet, on the same sheet-today they arrived: they are transferred back to the sheet they came from by exactly
+# the transfer rules and lines (see transfer.POST.yml), then this sheet records PERSON_TRANSFER_UNDONE and its ROLLUP and
+# TOTALS lines. 422, storing nothing, for anyone but a steward, a person who did not arrive by transfer, any later day,
+# or anything a transfer refuses; 404 for a person not on the sheet. Responds with the person as they arrived back.
